<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.rhythm.analyzes ~ run one analysis lens

`lens` chooses the instrument: changes, rhythm, couple (house name ki), cohere (house name li), square, lead, forecast, mismatch. The first five read the poured sensorium; lead, forecast and mismatch read the `rows` matrix the caller hands in (`names` labels its columns) and touch no plane. A missing or unknown lens refuses naming every lens, and an argument the lens reads none of refuses by name.

On the terminal the matrix rides `signal=<ndjson>`; each lens reads its own params:

changes    where the poured content changes hands (spectral=true, halves=<w,w>, span=<n>)

rhythm     the landed regimes and their couples (repour=true re-derives first, channel=<c>)

couple     do the sensorium's coupled peers reconcile (the H¹ gate); also ki

cohere     do the sensorium's planes glue into one section; also li

square     do a child-host's lobes round-trip to one self (bare: the mesh)

lead       who leads whom across signals, the R reference (signal=<ndjson>, names=<a,b>)

forecast   does a regime shift approach, the R early-warning read (signal=<ndjson>)

mismatch   do couple and lead agree over the same signals (signal=<ndjson>, names=<a,b>)

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///sense.rhythm.analyzes", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ lens · spectral · halves · span · repour · channel · rows · signal · names · sensorium

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lens` params=`takes/word ~ the plane or instrument`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`spectral` params=`~ read change-points spectrally`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`halves` params=`takes/word ~ the halving scales, e.g. 4,8,16`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`span` params=`takes/count ~ the change-point span`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`repour` params=`~ re-derive the rhythm plane first`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`channel` params=`takes/word ~ one channel stratum (speech, thought, tool)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rows` params=`takes/json skins/mcp ~ the signal matrix, rows as time and columns as signals`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`names` params=`takes/json ~ the column labels`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/word skins/mcp ~ the sensorium by name; absent, memory (the terminal names it before the verb: lares sense <sensorium> <verb>)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`signal` params=`takes/host-path skins/cli ~ the signal matrix as ndjson (lead, forecast, mismatch)`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

